This seems a good idea. Just to keep things balanced we should add a
random depending on the alignment of the resurrected character (maybe
looking at the alignment points too): a chaotic character is less likely
to help you than a lawful one. He may attack you instead of being of help!
This can be a major problem if you resurrect a strong character and he gets
angry.
Another chance is that instead to  become your pet he donates you some item
in its pack (may be asking you "What item do you wish?"), obviously uncursed.

And what about resurrecting dead monsters, should they be grateful with
you that you resurrected them, after killing them? :-)
